{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trivia Deal is the world\u2019s first trivia roguelike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Answer fast. Play smart. Use lifelines, swap cards, and relics to survive the Rainbow Reaper. Each run is unforgiving, one wrong answer can end it all. High-stakes strategy with random questions, categories, and rewards that keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Card_Dealing.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Build Your Trivia Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is unique. Choose your path through randomized columns, stack category advantages, and prepare for what's ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Shop.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Purchase Unique Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between rounds, spend your hard-earned gold on lifelines, relics, and rare swap cards. Plan your purchases\u2014each decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Combine.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Combine Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger lifelines like 50/50, Frenzy, and Double Dicey. Chain effects for huge rewards\u2014or burn them trying. Risk and timing are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Swap_Cards.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Swap the Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always get stuck with that one topic? Use a Swap Card to trade unwanted trivia for something you actually know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Reaper.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Defeat the Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the Rainbow Reaper in twisted boss rounds that test more than just your trivia knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2,000+ multiple choice questions </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 trivia categories </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12 lifeline abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">90+ swap packs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 levels to defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original soundtrack</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2820760?t=1752552981","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752552981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/26a5632320aaa7ac492cddda446094857c743a0c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752552981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/26a5632320aaa7ac492cddda446094857c743a0c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752552981","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2829590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Official Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Trivia Deal is the world\u2019s first trivia roguelike.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Answer fast. Play smart. Use lifelines, swap cards, and relics to survive the Rainbow Reaper. Each run is unforgiving, one wrong answer can end it all. High-stakes strategy with random questions, categories, and rewards that keep every run fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Card_Dealing.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Build Your Trivia Deck</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each run is unique. Choose your path through randomized columns, stack category advantages, and prepare for what's ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Shop.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Purchase Unique Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between rounds, spend your hard-earned gold on lifelines, relics, and rare swap cards. Plan your purchases\u2014each decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Combine.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Combine Powerful Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trigger lifelines like 50/50, Frenzy, and Double Dicey. Chain effects for huge rewards\u2014or burn them trying. Risk and timing are everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Swap_Cards.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Swap the Odds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Always get stuck with that one topic? Use a Swap Card to trade unwanted trivia for something you actually know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2820760/extras/Reaper.gif?t=1752552981\" /></div>Defeat the Reaper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the Rainbow Reaper in twisted boss rounds that test more than just your trivia knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragr